pe=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>中间等式给出标准并集记号，末项是只使用成员关系的外延展开；并集公理保证这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 存在。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}setop\\text{-}union\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S(U,F)\\leftrightarrow U=\\bigcup F\\land\\forall x\\;(x\\in U\\leftrightarrow\\exists A\\in F\\;(x\\in A))","display":true},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":735,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd5c17d95dadab7c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S$ is the family-union predicate (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]])"},{"id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\bigcup\\mathcal U$ is the union of a set-family as in [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]]"},{"id":"93870bfe2a48922a","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetopUnionFamily}_S$ is the family-union predicate (see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]])"},{"id":"d942276aed0f18b2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ and restriction are as in [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]; family union and $\\omega$ are as in [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]] and [[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3482","locations":["正文"],